1 REM ***************************************************************
2 REM * TETRIS FOR UKNC (ELEKTRONIKA MS 0511), CASSETTE BASIC        *
3 REM * VILNIUS 1988.09.28, TEXT SCREEN 64X24.                       *
4 REM * THE ACTIVE PIECE IS UPDATED BY CELL DIFF: A MOVE REPRINTS    *
5 REM * ONLY THE CELLS THAT REALLY CHANGED, SO IT DOES NOT BLINK.    *
6 REM * THE BLINKING TWIN OF THIS PROGRAM IS TETRISC.BAS.            *
7 REM ***************************************************************
8 REM THIS BASIC HAS NO STATEMENT SEPARATOR: ONE STATEMENT PER LINE.
9 REM IT HAS NO GRAPHICS EITHER - LINE AND PSET ANSWER WITH ERROR 5.
10 REM AND IT MUST NOT TOUCH COLOR: A CELL PRINTED AFTER COLOR KEEPS A
11 REM COLOURED BLOCK THAT PRINTING SPACES OVER IT DOES NOT CLEAR, SO
12 REM THE GAME STAYS IN THE COLOURS THE MACHINE BOOTS WITH.
13 REM ONLY THE FIRST TWO LETTERS OF A NAME ARE SIGNIFICANT, SO EVERY
14 REM VARIABLE IS TWO LETTERS. SC, SY AND LP ARE TAKEN BY THE SYSTEM
15 REM AND CANNOT BE ASSIGNED AT ALL. DICTIONARY:
16 REM  BW BH BOARD SIZE     BD BOARD ARRAY     BX BY WELL ORIGIN
17 REM  CT CR CX CY CURRENT PIECE               NT NEXT PIECE TYPE
18 REM  PT PR PX PY PREVIOUS PIECE              SI SHAPE INDEX
19 REM  SX TY SHAPE CELLS    NR SP ROTATIONS AND SPAWN COLUMN
20 REM  KX KY KN KICKS       KA KV NK KEY CODES AND ACTIONS
21 REM  GD LD AG GRAVITY, LOCK AND GRACE DELAYS IN TICKS PER LEVEL
22 REM  AX AY OLD CELLS      NX NY NEW CELLS    GX GY CELL TO PRINT
23 REM  TK GT LK GR LR UP TICK, GRAVITY, LOCK, GROUNDED, RESETS, LIFT
24 REM  SR LN LV NC SCORE, LINES, LEVEL, ROWS CLEARED NOW
25 REM  LT RC LAST PIECE AND REPEAT COUNT       FL 0 RUN 1 OVER 2 QUIT
26 REM  DC EC DB DRAWN, ERASED, DEBUG FLAG
27 REM  KB KC AK ES KEY CHAR, CODE, ACTION, ESCAPE PENDING
28 REM  HX HUD COLUMN        PV PIECE IN PREVIEW
29 REM  H EX EY COLLISION SCRATCH   I J X Y Z W LOOP SCRATCH
30 REM  RX RY ROTATION SCRATCH      CB CE BLOCK AND BLANK
31 REM LINE MAP: 100 CONFIG, 200 TABLES, 300 NEW GAME, 400 MAIN LOOP,
32 REM 500 GAME OVER, 1000 KEYS, 2000 SPAWN, 3000 MOVES, 3300 COLLIDE,
33 REM 4000 ROTATE, 5000 DIFF, 6000 LOCK AND LINES, 7000 HUD,
34 REM 8000 CELL PRINTING, 9000 DEBUG, 10000 DATA.
35 REM  HS HP RECORD NAMES AND POINTS   HI NEW ROW IN THE TABLE
36 REM  HN NAME BEING TYPED IN          7400 RECORDS, 7500 TABLE
99 GOTO 100
